  "citation": "Burns S P; Blanken P D; Monson R K (2020): Data, Photographs, Videos, and Information for the Niwot Ridge Subalpine Forest (US-NR1) AmeriFlux site. AmeriFlux Management Project. Dataset. doi:10.15485/1671825",
  "dataset": {
